cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "OpenEGCS: A Deterministic Discrete-Event Simulation Platform for Benchmarking Elevator Dispatch Algorithms"
abstract: >-
  A discrete-event simulator for benchmarking elevator dispatch algorithms, with
  pluggable dispatch, group dispatch, route ordering, traffic and passenger
  policies, kinematic travel and electromechanical energy models from the
  literature, deterministic seeded runs, and reference implementations of
  published dispatch algorithms. A modified version of liftsim (2011).
authors:
  - family-names: Fioreze
    given-names: Bernardo
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/BernardoFioreze/OpenEGCS"
keywords:
  - elevator
  - dispatching
  - group control
  - discrete-event simulation
  - benchmarking
references:
